Schedule independent migrations without blocking unrelated tasks

Combine the existing implementation and corrections:

- Keep unrelated resume and metadata reads outside rollout migration waits
- Reserve bounded concurrent migration jobs across processes
- Release maintenance locks before inherited descriptors close
- Serialize history schema initialization across app-server processes
- Schedule independent rollout migrations using bounded dependency reservations
- Cover migration overlap, dependency changes, retry and recovery isolation
- Release migration jobs before projection lifecycle waits

